If x = 1, what is the output of the following program segment?
```c
printf("x=%d\n", x);
printf("x=%d\n", ++x);
printf("x=%d\n", x);
```

What will be the output of the following code segment?
```c
int num[] = {3,5,7,10,20};
printf("%d", num[3]);
```

What will be the output of the following C code?
```c
main()
{
    int a = 11;
    while(a <= 20)
    {
        printf("%d", a);
        a += 2;
    }
}
```

Write the output of the following code.
```c
void main(void)
{
    int i, j;
    for(i = 1; i <= 5; i++)
    {
        for(j = 1; j <= i; j++)
            printf("%d", j*2);
        printf("\n");
    }
}
```

What will be the output of the following program segment?
```c
for(i = 1; i < 5; i++)
    if(i == 3)
        continue;
    else
        printf("%d", i);
```

What will be the output of the following program statements?
```c
for(int x = 1; x <= 5; x++)
{
    for(int y = 1; y <= x; y++)
        printf("%d", y);
    printf("\n");
}
```

